        <briefdescription>
<para>Inserts any necessary instructions at position <computeroutput>Pos</computeroutput> relative to instruction <computeroutput>MI</computeroutput> to ensure any subsequent memory instructions of this thread with address spaces <computeroutput>AddrSpace</computeroutput> will observe the previous memory operations by any thread for memory scopes up to memory scope <computeroutput>Scope</computeroutput> . </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true iff any instructions inserted. </para>
